<title>USA: U.S. orange juice stocks in cold storage - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. orange juice stocks in cold storage - USDA.</headline>
<text>
<p>WASHINGTON, Feb 21 (Reuter) USDA report of frozen concentrated orange juice stocks in cold storage, in 1,000s of units:</p>
<p>    -	 01/31/97   12/31/96---Rev from    01/31/96</p>
<p> Gallons     149,277    108,061    108,119     130,901</p>
<p> Lbs	 1,477,241  1,069,372  1,069,945   1,295,401</p>
<p>Note-FCOJ stocks are based on 42.0 degrees Brix equivalent of 9.896 lbs per gallon.</p>
</text>
